eger that is the number of distinct colors visible on the resultant\r\nwall.\r\nTechnical Specification\r\n∙ 1 ≤ 𝑛 ≤ 4000\r\n∙ 0 ≤ 𝑥1 < 𝑥2 < 2\r\n28, 0 ≤ 𝑦2 < 𝑦1 < 2\r\n28, 1 ≤ 𝑐 ≤ 𝑛, for every poster\r\nSample Input 1\r\n3\r\n1 6 3 3 1\r\n3 4 6 1 2\r\n2 5 5 2 1\r\nSample Output 1\r\n2\r\nSample Input 2\r\n3\r\n2 3 3 2 3\r\n1 4 4 1 1\r\n5 4 6 3 2\r\nSample Output 2\r\n2\r\nSample Input 3\r\n3\r\n0 1 2 0 1\r\n0 1 1 0 2\r\n2 1 3 0 2\r\nSample Output 3\r\n2\r\n16",
